From 440a234f2d9d7e9f2e6eb3bd800ef39eb6f733a1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Claude (SGR dev session)" <claude@sgr-dev.local>
Date: Sat, 29 Aug 2026 06:06:14 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] test(market_data): cover FeatureStore (26% -> 100%)

- Add tests/market_data/test_feature_store.py: 18 tests covering
  sgr/market_data/feature_store.py's FeatureStore, the Redis-backed
  feature cache used by the Strategy Engine (Market Data -> Features
  step of the trading lifecycle).
- Reuses the AsyncMock/patch(aioredis.from_url) mocking pattern
  already established in tests/unit/test_event_bus.py to exercise
  real FeatureStore code paths without a live Redis server.
- Covers: connect()/close()/_require_connected(), save() (pipeline
  writes for timestamped + latest keys with correct per-timeframe
  TTL incl. default-TTL fallback, pub/sub notify), get_latest()
  (hit/miss/deserialize-error), get_at() (hit/miss/deserialize-error),
  get_many_latest() (mixed hit/miss/corrupt batch, empty list),
  invalidate(), and the get_feature_store() singleton.
- No production code changes. Full suite verified green: 1059
  passed, 9 skipped, 0 failed. Coverage 87.85% -> 88.75%. ruff
  unchanged (22, pre-existing). mypy sgr/ unchanged (118,
  pre-existing).
